{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f0ab3fd345fc7efff705b8cae248edb4d928253ab03c546cf440a8fc1379d0bc",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_a:2_4_028_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce0f856d28efda319b1eeeafa49d48661f3bb5cabe5d97294eef3deb1cdbd843",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n现在可以耽误您一点时间说说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_a:2_4_028_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea803d7ecff7410f61f1e633c2659f895dea0d1b507c5a19dbb7219361ecc990",
      "text": "前几天的时装秀待命时，我在后台\n看到了工作人员们的身影……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_a:2_4_028_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23bcdb5fdae69cc66f8502074ac47054f7ea3b85f5c643ebc047c7bb44aa5c3a",
      "text": "为了传达出自己所坚信的服装的魅力，\n他们都在拼命地工作着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_a:2_4_028_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10debf4a2de20b6e1eb9ad1cf2b71f603d7aa3b61dea68c5cd6b2f4ca1617f1c",
      "text": "虽然看起来行色匆匆，\n但每个人都在闪闪发光……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_a:2_4_028_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bcce2ec60ef7a47efc3b00a68b3d122af2b7b0d852bd772ac4a08f9ba87c992",
      "text": "那副模样，与为了我们四处奔波的\n制作人的身影重叠在了一起。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_a:2_4_028_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1636e911852a93e5a59788264e623e23722b0bafeea8021ac51ba0a849270eb",
      "text": "再次……由衷感谢您一直以来的付出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_a:2_4_028_01_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba95bc6b0046e6b275f0811b28200c009e2c813a96086fe255c4d40b42105cf9",
      "text": "我才要感谢您呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_a:2_4_028_01_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11811ed1ab35dc547d4b9f4a6c4df027d1c7936f4af81d93cc871f1f72ef22a6",
      "text": "因为我想让庄一郎先生\n他们大放异彩",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_a:2_4_028_01_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1462399880cab5296a8ee1a0cd172415c4cb693058a4ebba9b09e2569b1d2ab1",
      "text": "谢谢您。\n今后为了不辜负您的期待，我会继续努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_a:2_4_028_01_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14a78cedef2a05c8160a98f925ab4e1586a0d042b35f005e4c2769dc3f9b3826",
      "text": "必须好好回应这份心意才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_a:2_4_028_01_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:475f49204761166ba1bb4524f7fe238f652f207bdad17e79194cee8db0af638d",
      "text": "我打算将这次的工作化为养分，\n更加努力奋进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_401_2_4_028_01_09_a:2_4_028_01_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8983a5d3609e3474c240071d19b7d9aa4fc91ab9811a02d50662eb2d1ae01e70",
      "text": "今后也请多多关照了，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
